    "title": "Persona 5 Royal - JP Themes",
    "description": "P5R - JP Wallpaper Theme (Version 1.6)\n \nThis is a Wallpaper Engine theme based on the Japanese Persona 5 Royal\nthemes available on the PS4. \nEvery character is included and several music tracks can be used.\n \nCredits:\nAtlus (for obvious reasons)\nPan-hime for the P5R assets.\n \n----------------------------\nRecommended settings:\n\nQuality: High/Ultra\nFramerate: 60\nSpeed: 100\n\nOr for lower end system:\nQuality: Normal/Low\nFramerate: 60 / 30\nSpeed: 100 at 60fps or 125 at 30 fps.\n\n----------------------------\nChangelog (V1.6)\n- Added Alright, Alright ELP and New Beginnings as music tracks.\n\nChangelog (V1.5.1)\n- Added Rivers in the Desert Instrumental and Dual Mix.\n\nChangelog (V1.5)\n- Added Rivers in the Desert, Beneath the Mask (Vocal and Instrumental)\nper request.\n\nChangelog (V1.4.5)\n- Added Break it Down & Break it Down ELP version per request by\niiReTr0Z\n\nChangelog (V1.4)\n- Added 7 Vanilla tracks:\n- Last Surprise.\n- Tokyo Daylight.\n- Sunset Bridge.\n- Butterfly Kiss.\n- Layer Cake.\n- Days of Sisters.\n- Price.\n\nWill try to get theme randomization working soon. Having some trouble.\n\nChangelog (V1.3)\n- Removed @copyright text from each background.\n\nChangelog (V1.1)\n- Fixed Position of the Twins vertical loop, preventing\n  that a red backdrop can be seen.",
